G1 E{flush_length_4 * 0.18} F{flush_volumetric_speeds[next_extruder]/2.4053*60}
G1 E{flush_length_4 * 0.02} F50
G1 E{flush_length_4 * 0.18} F{flush_volumetric_speeds[next_extruder]/2.4053*60}
